17	/*
18	 * ai_agent_ui — CP-side (路 B) UI renderer entry point.
19	 *
20	 * BK7258 dual-core: CP (CPU0) owns LCD/LVGL/FPU/GDMA, AP (CPU1) runs the
21	 * agent.  This standalone NSH builtin builds ONLY the LVGL chat-view assets
22	 * (lvgl_ui_channel + lvgl_toast + MiSans CJK font) on the CP core, without
23	 * pulling agent_main / llm / voice / TLS.  voice_channel_* and
24	 * message_bus are stubbed here (cp_stubs.c) — CP only renders; TTS/ASR live
25	 * on AP and will drive this UI over the AP→CP UI RPMsg endpoint in a
26	 * follow-up slice.
27	 *
28	 * For now this is a bring-up smoke test: launch from CP NSH, it inits the
29	 * chat view, lights the round screen with our own widgets, and posts one
30	 * test bubble — proving the ai_agent UI assets run on the real CP+LCD
31	 * (M3 prerequisite, before the RPMsg transport is layered on).
32	 */
33	
