172	   * needs to be ready before the first bubble is dispatched.  The link comes
173	   * up at boot, so by the time the AP agent has network + a reply to show,
174	   * ui_rpmsg_ready() is true. */
175	  syslog(LOG_INFO, "[%s] registered; waiting for CP UI link\n", TAG);
