1389	/* Water-ripple idle shimmer for the "请说" pill.  Two independent animators
1390	 * run on distinct periods so the effect reads as a soft surface undulation
1391	 * rather than a mechanical blink:
1392	 *   water_opa_cb   — opacity breathes 255..190 (the surface dims/brightens)
